# Hugo output
/public/
/resources/_gen/
/.hugo_build.lock

# Hugo module/cache directories
# `hugo mod vendor` writes to _vendor/, not vendor/ (the theme is pulled as a
# Hugo module and tracked via go.mod/go.sum, so the vendored copy stays out).
/_vendor/
/hugo_stats.json

# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md
# Skills are version-controlled so they survive a clone; the rest of .claude/ is
# machine-local (launch.json, worktrees/) and stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

